WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.580
«I'm afraid of a no.»

2
00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:03.230
A no is just a no.

3
00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.250
One of many that bring you closer to a yes.

4
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.670
And silence is a «not now».

5
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.220
RelAI reads the no

6
00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:11.890
together with you. It tells apart a no,

7
00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.630
an objection, a

8
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.420
«let's talk again later».

9
00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:19.390
Whoever said no doesn't get archived: they come back around later,

10
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.680
with a new angle. And when a no knocks you down,

11
00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:25.170
the Consultant brings you back to your why.

12
00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:27.170
Yeses and nos are gathered.

13
00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.210
They aren't forced.
